<title>NEW ZEALAND: RBNZ to tender NZ$100 mln of four-yr bonds Jun 12.</title>
<headline>RBNZ to tender NZ$100 mln of four-yr bonds Jun 12.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of New Zealand said on Thursday it would offer NZ$100 million of February 2001 government bonds at its next tender on June 12.</p>
<p>The bonds have an 8.00 percent coupon and mature on February 15. Settlement date for successful bidders is June 17.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 4734 746</p>
</text>
